Proactively identify blockers, flag risks, and escalate when needed to ensure timely, high-quality deliverables;
Prepare and share regular project status reports;
Support project financial tracking (basic reporting and forecasting) alongside the Senior PM;
Contribute to a collaborative team culture built on trust, accountability, and continuous improvement.

